## 1. Executive Summary

LoopLedger is a prototype for observing whether human involvement in AI-assisted decisions is substantive. It combines a risk gate, a human review queue, reviewer behaviour indicators, and an auditable event log.

This document records observed demo signals and limitations. It does **not** demonstrate legal compliance or production fitness.

